DK/issues/1505", "id": 897504752, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s41ftXw", "user": {"login": "reedev", "id": 2393764, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjIzOTM3NjQ=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2393764?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev", "html_url": "https://github.com/reedev", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/reedev/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2021-08-12T09:56:01Z", "updated_at": "2021-08-12T09:56:01Z", "body": "I guess it might be good to describe what you are trying to achieve. What is your setup wrt PX4 or ArduPilot, etc. What have you tried so far? Giving more details will allow people to help you better.", "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/897504752/reactions", "total_count": 2, "+1": 2, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/897607895", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1505#issuecomment-897607895", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1505", "id": 897607895, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s41gGjX", "user": {"login": "JonasVautherin", "id": 2606672, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI2MDY2Nz